WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.875
Use the base and the height at a right angle.

2
00:00:03.853 --> 00:00:07.553
There are three lengths: a base, a height, and a slanted side.

3
00:00:08.531 --> 00:00:12.881
The slanted side changes as the top moves. The area does not.

4
00:00:18.172 --> 00:00:21.547
So use the base and the height: twenty square centimetres.
